# Runtime state, not source. Without this, `docker compose up --build` on a machine that has
# already run OpenDockWatch bakes the developer's own sqlite database into the image - metrics
# and event history, the session store, and the settings table holding the alert webhook URL
# (which embeds a Discord/Gotify/ntfy token). A published image would carry all of it.
data

